"""
api_keys.py.example -- template for the local api_keys.py file.

Copy this file to api_keys.py (same folder) and fill in your own key(s).
api_keys.py itself is gitignored, so your real keys are never committed or
pushed to GitHub -- you can pull/push this repo freely without having to
scrub secrets out of gateway_web_stable.py first.

Add any future API keys the same way: one "NAME_API_KEY = \"...\"" line each.
"""

